\subsubsection*{Training}
For each of the above tasks, we experiment with two training settings. For the text classification task, the training and test examples are taken from the same domain, i.e., Wikipedia articles. For the reading comprehension task, we train with SQuAD~\cite{rajpurkar2016squad} and test on the dev and test sets of SQuAD.
